<h2 class="doc-h2">Trigger Delays</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The two delays are different numbers for a reason: opening slowly stops a card appearing every
    time the pointer crosses a link, and closing slowly lets you move onto the card without it
    vanishing under you.
</p>
